  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "multi-hit then charge through frontal area",
    "skill1": "form pact with left and right allies at battle start, continuously increasing their stats",
    "skill2": "deal damage and stun nearby enemies twice",
    "skill3": "battle haste increase",
    "skill4": "enhanced bond continuously accumulates bonuses while partners live",
    "skill5": "ultimate converts portion of damage dealt to self-healing"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Sonja]] forms a **battle-start pact with her left and right allies**, continuously raising their stats while all three remain alive. Her ultimate delivers multi-hit damage, then charges through a frontal area while converting part of its damage into self-healing. An area skill stuns nearby enemies twice for soft control at the front. The enhanced bond accumulates bonuses while the partners survive, and battle Haste growth keeps her rotation fluid. She is a frontline buffer who needs flanking allies and dense enemy clusters; without them, her buffs and stun swings underwhelm.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Sonja]]'s battle-start pact continuously buffs the left and right allies while all three live; her multi-hit charge is secondary. Priority-delete the pact partners with high-damage melee like [[Himmel]] or [[Zandrok]], or inhibit a rear partner with [[filter:backline-inhibit]] like [[Bonnie]]. Do not cluster into the charge, and do not rely on ult-cancel during its control-immune cast. Race your carry with [[filter:energy-provider]] like [[Thador]] or [[Hugin]] before Haste growth locks the front."
}
